David Arthur created KAFKA-15532:
------------------------------------

             Summary: ZkWriteBehindLag should not be reported by inactive c=
ontrollers
                 Key: KAFKA-15532
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-15532
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Bug
    Affects Versions: 3.6.0
            Reporter: David Arthur


Since only the active controller is performing the dual-write to ZK during =
a migration, it should be the only controller to report the ZkWriteBehindLa=
g metric.=C2=A0

=C2=A0

Currently, if the controller fails over during a migration, the previous ac=
tive controller will incorrectly report its last value for ZkWriteBehindLag=
 forever. Instead, it should report zero.



