>>>> Hi,
>>>>
>>>> I did not pay attention to this KIP in the past; seems it was on-hold for a while.
>>>>
>>>> Overall it sounds very useful, and I think we should extend this with a follow up KIP for Kafka Streams. What is unclear to me at this point is the statement:
