>>>>> Kafka Streams applications have an application.id configured and this identifier should be included as the application_id metrics label.
>>>>
>>>> The `application.id` is currently only used as the (main) consumer's `group.id` (and is part of an auto-generated `client.id` if the user does not set one).
>>>>
>>>> This comment related to:
