>>>>
>>>>
>>>>
>>>>> The following method is added to the Producer, Consumer, and Admin client interfaces:
>>>>
>>>> Should we add anything to Kafka Streams to expose the underlying clients' assigned client-instance-ids programmatically? I am also wondering if clients should report their assigned client-instance-ids as metrics itself (for this case, Kafka Streams won't need to do anything, because we already expose all client metrics).
>>>>
>>>> If we add anything programmatic, we need to make it simple, given that Kafka Streams has many clients per `StreamThread` and may have multiple threads.
