>>>>> put(k, null, time=10)
>>>>> put(k, null, time=15)
>>>>> put(k, v2, time=20)
>>>>>
>>>>> the result with tombstones would be
>>>>>
>>>>> value, timestamp
>>>>> (v1, 0)
>>>>> (null, 5)
>>>>> (null, 10)
>>>>> (null, 15)
>>>>> (v2, 20)
>>>>>
>>>>> instead of
>>>>>
>>>>> value, timestamp, validTo
