Currently, instantiating a membershipManager means the member will always s=
eek to join a group unless it has failed fatally.=C2=A0 However, this is no=
t always the case because the member should be able to join and leave a gro=
up any time during its life cycle. Maybe we should include an "inactive" st=
ate in the state machine indicating the member does not want to be in a reb=
alance group.



