Apoorv Mittal created KAFKA-15684:
-------------------------------------

             Summary: Add support to describe all subscriptions through utility
                 Key: KAFKA-15684
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-15684
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Apoorv Mittal
            Assignee: Apoorv Mittal


Open PR to support client-metrics through kafka-configs.sh doesn't list all subscriptions. The functionality is missing because of missing support to list client subscription in config repository and admin client. This task should provide a workaround to fetch all subscriptions from config repository by adding a method in KRaftMetadataCache. Later a KIP might be needed to add support in AdminClient.



