David Arthur created KAFKA-15698:
------------------------------------

             Summary: KRaft mode brokers should clean up stray partitions from migration
                 Key: KAFKA-15698
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-15698
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: David Arthur


Follow up to KAFKA-15605. After the brokers are migrated to KRaft and the migration is completed, we should let the brokers clean up any partitions that we marked as "stray" during the migration. This would be any partition that was being deleted when the migration began, or any partition that was deleted, but not seen as deleted by StopReplica (e.g., broker down).



